{"name": "Dang Darn Island", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019ve finally found the mysterious <strong>Dang Darn Island</strong>! Now the only thing standing between you and the legendary <strong>Gold Idol</strong> is an ancient temple filled with slithering snakes, pointy spikes, flamethrowers, poison darts, and a grumpy volcano who just might lose his cool at any moment.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Piece of cake, right?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Search The Island!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Smash pots, unlock chests, and leave no stone unturned in your hunt for valuable items, treasure, and clues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"240\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1802370/extras/8776f0cda24ab8c8876ad94f993dd9fe.poster.avif?t=1780066045\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1802370/extras/8776f0cda24ab8c8876ad94f993dd9fe.webm?t=1780066045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1802370/extras/8776f0cda24ab8c8876ad94f993dd9fe.mp4?t=1780066045\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Dodge Traps!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are more than a few ways to get caught off guard in this labyrinth of doom. Watch your step and keep your eyes peeled for danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"240\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1802370/extras/d627c9526c276f8eb5036c073198db9f.poster.avif?t=1780066045\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1802370/extras/d627c9526c276f8eb5036c073198db9f.webm?t=1780066045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1802370/extras/d627c9526c276f8eb5036c073198db9f.mp4?t=1780066045\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Appease The Volcano!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Better stay on Paul Cano\u2019s good side or things will heat up quickly. An offering or two\u2026or three\u2026might help.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"240\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1802370/extras/4d6f4383f2639d12d7bf429efa2b2470.poster.avif?t=1780066045\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1802370/extras/4d6f4383f2639d12d7bf429efa2b2470.webm?t=1780066045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1802370/extras/4d6f4383f2639d12d7bf429efa2b2470.mp4?t=1780066045\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Collect Treasure!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Gold Idol may be your ultimate prize, but don\u2019t forget to grab all the coins you can along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"240\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1802370/extras/44219f7611a69daa0c7649c625103ec0.poster.avif?t=1780066045\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1802370/extras/44219f7611a69daa0c7649c625103ec0.webm?t=1780066045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1802370/extras/44219f7611a69daa0c7649c625103ec0.mp4?t=1780066045\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Invite Your Pals!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It\u2019s rough out there for a lonely adventurer. Invite some friends for online or local split screen multiplayer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"240\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1802370/extras/0bd950d71e6c1d1afca5afb320b6b86a.poster.avif?t=1780066045\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1802370/extras/0bd950d71e6c1d1afca5afb320b6b86a.webm?t=1780066045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1802370/extras/0bd950d71e6c1d1afca5afb320b6b86a.mp4?t=1780066045\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Dang Darn Island is a 1-4 player co-op roguelike adventure. Explore the procedurally generated island, delve deep into the temple, smash pots, dodge traps, and see if you can escape with the Gold Idol before the angry volcano loses his temper!", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1802370/2ad67e8292face2b2c4e1c8a2cd1dd0627a0317d/header.jpg?t=1780066045", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Roguelike", "Top-Down", "Procedural Generation", "Co-op", "3D", "Action"], "developers": "Dang Darn Games", "publishers": "Dang Darn Games", "release_date": "May 29, 2026", "price": "$9.99", "appid": "1802370", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "29 May 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/juymNVAb5Wo", "first_seen": 1780005600.0, "review_rank": 560}